.</source> <volume>11</volume>:<fpage>1799</fpage>&#x02013;1804.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11719224</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib30"><citation citation-type="journal">Zhao, W.G., M.H. Byrne, B.F. Boyce, and S.M. Krane. <year>1999</year>. Bone resorption induced by parathyroid hormone is strikingly diminished in collagenase-resistant mutant mice. <source>J. Clin. Invest.</source> <volume>103</volume>:<fpage>517</fpage>&#x02013;524.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10021460</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>